Rel(act_receptionist, sys_booking, "Runs the clinic day", "HTTPS")
Rel(act_dentist, sys_booking, "Views own day", "HTTPS")
Rel(act_practice_manager, sys_booking, "Sets up, reads report", "HTTPS")
Rel(sys_booking, act_sms_provider, "Sends codes and reminders", "HTTPS REST")
Rel(sys_booking, act_whatsapp_provider, "Sends reminders", "HTTPS REST")
Rel(act_sms_provider, sys_booking, "Reports delivery, STOP", "Webhook")
Rel(act_whatsapp_provider, sys_booking, "Reports delivery", "Webhook")
```

## 2. Requirements and drivers

